# AdVerse Agency Manager needs NO environment variables.
#
# Everything is configured without env vars:
# - Google Sheet ID + Apps Script webhook: Tools & Settings -> Sheet & Apps
#   Script Sync (saved to .sheet_config.json, which ships with the repo).
# - Firebase: firebase-applet-config.json (imported directly by the app).
# - Admin/Viewer PINs: built-in defaults, changeable in-app, persisted in
#   the data store.
# - Port: set automatically by the host (DEFAULT_APP_PORT) or 3000.
#
# This file intentionally declares no variables so hosting tools (e.g.
# Google AI Studio) do not prompt for values on import.
